      "Query Priority Guidance: Recommended priority hierarchy (getByRole -> getByLabelText -> getByText -> getByTestId).",
      "Interaction Simulation: High-fidelity user event dispatching via userEvent.setup().",
      "MSW Dual-Mode Interception: Mocking at the network boundary in browser (Service Worker) and Node.js test runners (Request Interception)."
